WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.882
This example intentionally fails The active-patient
view shows only

00:00:05.895 --> 00:00:11.462
active rows and includes a check option The update
tries to set an active

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:17.171
patient to inactive through that view Because the
resulting row would no longer

00:00:17.198 --> 00:00:22.937
satisfy the view condition PostgreSQL rejects the
update This

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.529
is expected behavior
